# What Notes can do for Bella (docs/registry-design.md). Bella's commands,
# the model's prompt and the window server's checks are made from this.
app notes

action write
  about write text down in Notes
  effect change
  slots text
  verbs write down | write | add | put | note down | note that | jot down | take a note that | take a note | make a note that | make a note
  places in my notes | to my notes | in notes | to notes | in the notes app | in a note | in my notes app | on my list | to my list | down

action remove
  about take a line or an item out of Notes
  effect delete
  slots text
  verbs remove | delete | erase | take | cross off | cross | scratch | get rid of | drop
  places from my notes | from notes | from the notes | off my notes | out of my notes | off my list | off the list | from my list | from the list | for my notes | in my notes | off | out
  ask Remove "{text}" from your notes?

action change
  about change words in Notes
  effect change
  slots old new
  joins to | with | for | into
  verbs change | replace | swap | switch | edit | correct
  places in my notes | in notes | on my list
